{"id":"433037f9b53db530","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-so-formula.md","title":"Second-Order Formula","display":"df-so-formula — Second-Order Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-so-formula","aliases":["57-df-so-formula"],"display":"df-so-formula — Second-Order Formula","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","[[57-df-so-var]]","[[57-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-so-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-so-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-so-formula — Second-Order Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d06cd82e12837aa5\" href=\"?note=d06cd82e12837aa5\" title=\"57-df-so-var\">57-df-so-var</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为固定语言，项、原子公式与二阶变量取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d06cd82e12837aa5\" href=\"?note=d06cd82e12837aa5\" title=\"57-df-so-var\">57-df-so-var</a>。所有构造子产生带标签的有限语法树。保留本文件原来的原始联结词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\land,\\lor\">\\(\\neg,\\land,\\lor\\)</span>；本文件内 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\to\\beta\">\\(\\alpha\\to\\beta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\beta\">\\(\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\beta\\)</span> 是下式规定的缩写，而不是加入新的树构造子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_2\">\\(\\iota_2\\)</span> 是一阶公式到二阶语法的显式翻译。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_S^2\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\cup\\{X(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):n\\ge1\\land X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\\land(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_S^2\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\cup\\{X(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):n\\ge1\\land X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\\land(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_0^2\\coloneqq A_S^2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_0^2\\coloneqq A_S^2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{m+1}^2\\coloneqq F_m^2\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in F_m^2\\}\n\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\circ\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_m^2\\land\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\\}\n\\cup\\{Qz\\varphi:Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\land z\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\land\\varphi\\in F_m^2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{m+1}^2\\coloneqq F_m^2\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in F_m^2\\}\n\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\circ\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_m^2\\land\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\\}\n\\cup\\{Qz\\varphi:Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\land z\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\land\\varphi\\in F_m^2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}F_m^2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}F_m^2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\to\\beta\\coloneqq(\\neg\\alpha\\lor\\beta),\\qquad\n\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\beta\\coloneqq((\\neg\\alpha\\lor\\beta)\\land(\\neg\\beta\\lor\\alpha)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\to\\beta\\coloneqq(\\neg\\alpha\\lor\\beta),\\qquad\n\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\beta\\coloneqq((\\neg\\alpha\\lor\\beta)\\land(\\neg\\beta\\lor\\alpha)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_2(\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha&amp;&amp; (\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\n\\iota_2(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\iota_2(\\varphi),&amp;\n\\iota_2(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\iota_2(\\varphi)\\circ\\iota_2(\\psi)),\\\\\n\\iota_2(\\varphi\\to\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\neg\\iota_2(\\varphi)\\lor\\iota_2(\\psi)),\\\\\n\\iota_2(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n((\\neg\\iota_2(\\varphi)\\lor\\iota_2(\\psi))\\land(\\neg\\iota_2(\\psi)\\lor\\iota_2(\\varphi))),\\\\\n\\iota_2(Qx\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq Qx\\iota_2(\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_2(\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha&amp;&amp; (\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\n\\iota_2(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\iota_2(\\varphi),&amp;\n\\iota_2(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\iota_2(\\varphi)\\circ\\iota_2(\\psi)),\\\\\n\\iota_2(\\varphi\\to\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\neg\\iota_2(\\varphi)\\lor\\iota_2(\\psi)),\\\\\n\\iota_2(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n((\\neg\\iota_2(\\varphi)\\lor\\iota_2(\\psi))\\land(\\neg\\iota_2(\\psi)\\lor\\iota_2(\\varphi))),\\\\\n\\iota_2(Qx\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq Qx\\iota_2(\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限阶段生成代替未给载体的全类交。没有为“看起来更标准”而改变原二阶语法的原始联结词集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-var","status":"resolved","id":"d06cd82e12837aa5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-var]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为固定语言，项、原子公式与二阶变量取 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-atomic-formula]]、[[57-df-so-var]]。所有构造子产生带标签的有限语法树。保留本文件原来的原始联结词 $\\neg,\\